Eagle is an {{Uncommon}} [[Beast]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|550,000}} or {{Robux|975}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

The fruit grants the user a pair of anatomically accurate wings of a {{w|Bald Eagle}}, allowing the user to dominate the skies with unmatched speed and style. Eagle can soar, dive, and strike in rapid succession while bombarding enemies with explosive feathers.

