==Overview==
{{Tabber
|Pros|
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Relatively powerful fruit for PvP.
* Unmatched mobility, allowing the user to completely blitz most other fruits in nearly all sorts of environments.
* Good for grinding and sea events. 
* Versatile for various stat builds. 
* Cheap to obtain. 

|{{Ability|TAP}}
* Decent range, even longer when charged.
* Good for grinding.
* Quite fast. 
* Low knockback.
* Can be aimed vertically.

|{{Ability|Z}}
* Good for grinding lots of enemies.
* Can act as a reversal tool, as it pushes enemies back a good distance, similarly to [[Yeti]] [Z] move.
* Great combo extender. 

|{{Ability|X}}
* Decent [[Area of Effect|AoE]] attack.
* Good for when surrounded by enemies.
* Long stun.

|{{Ability|C}}
* Decent range.
* Relatively high damage compared to other {{Uncommon}} fruits.
* Long stun and little to no knockback.
* Great combo starter/extender.
* Can grab the enemy through a wall if used correctly, as long as the enemy is within the move's path.

|{{Ability|V}}
* Has an [[Area of Effect|AoE]] blast after the initial impact.
* Good mobility.
** Can fling the user very far with enough lag.
* Deals very good damage when all the slashes hit. 
* Is great to use as combo finisher, often useful after [[Godhuman]] [C].

|{{Ability|F}}
* The player is able to use other moves while flying, and is not limited to only the fruit's moves.
* Does not immediately cancel upon taking damage.
* Extremely fast speed, faster than [[Light]]'s [F] move due to the recent buff.
}}

|Cons|
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Requires moderate aiming skills.
* All moves distribute damage throughout multiple hitboxes, which means being at the edge of an attack allows the enemy to take less damage and possibly escape.
* Flight lasts only as long as the Feather Meter.
* All moves can be [[Instinct]]-tricked very easily, some of which can even leave an opening for the opponent to counter-attack.
* Almost all the moves lock the user in place, leaving them vulnerable to combos if missed. 

|{{Ability|TAP}}
* Low damage.
* Hitbox is quite a distance away from the user.
* Impractical for damage in PvP.
* Drains the meter decently fast, making it most of all at early mastery level pretty bad for grinding.

|{{Ability|Z}}
* Mediocre range.
* Not very reliable for combo starting.
* Can be dodged easily by side stepping. 
* Most of the damage can be dodged if the target stands at the edge.

|{{Ability|X}}
* Short range and no I-frames (The enemy can damage the user while not being able to stop the attack.)
* Target can escape if they are right at the edge of the attack.
* Slight startup, making this move a bit predictable.

|{{Ability|C}}
* Easy to miss.
* Single target, putting it at a disadvantage for grinding.
* Can cause some clipping. 
* Quite slow movement, not very helpful for mobility.
* Un-true stun.

|{{Ability|V}}
* Poor combo extender.
* Damage may be inconsistent at times.
* Most of the damage is situated to a small radius of the attack, making it reliable for damage only if hit directly.

|{{Ability|F}}
* Drains the meter quite fast.
* Will be cancelled either if the meter runs out, or if the user loses enough HP (around 25% HP with full meter), and it is very easy to run out when using [M1] or taking damage.
* Once HP drops below 30%, flight speed decreases, scaling down further as HP decreases.
}} 
}}

